{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不发脾气更吓人  (Even Scarier When He Stays Calm)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When the arrogant idol's entourage gets into a shoving match with Lin Jie's production crew, everyone expects Chun Yuqiao to explode—yet his icy calm turns out to be far more intimidating. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "贾喆刚到公司一上午，所有人对他好像都不太满意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "坏了，贾喆他们团队跟林姐那边开会，结果两方打起来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "打得好啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "打什么好啊？快点跟我一块劝架去吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用劝，他们的人打不过我的现场组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把那艺人的资料给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "调查过了，贾喆的数据属于硬炒作出来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "根本不是真正的粉丝人气，属于伪热度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "叫凯文来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你有没有觉得，他不发脾气反而更吓人？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "贾喆刚到公司一上午，所有人对他好像都不太满意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Jia Zhe has only been at the company one morning, and everyone already seems fed up with him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "坏了，贾喆他们团队跟林姐那边开会，结果两方打起来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bad news—Jia Zhe's team was in a meeting with Lin Jie's crew and a brawl broke out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "打得好啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good for them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "打什么好啊？快点跟我一块劝架去吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is good about fighting? Hurry and come break it up with me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用劝，他们的人打不过我的现场组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to step in—their entourage is no match for my floor crew.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把那艺人的资料给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hand me the file on that artist.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "调查过了，贾喆的数据属于硬炒作出来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We checked—Jia Zhe's online numbers were artificially hyped up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "根本不是真正的粉丝人气，属于伪热度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not genuine fan popularity at all; it is fake buzz.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "叫凯文来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Send Kaiwen in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你有没有觉得，他不发脾气反而更吓人？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you get the feeling he is even scarier when he does not lose his temper?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "贾喆刚到公司一上午，所有人对他好像都不太满意。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
